      },
      "lineNbr": 37,
      "author": {
        "id": 1069543
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-02-13T21:50:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "elements are allocated once and never deleted? Are we guaranteed that all initializations occur before any accesses? Are the elements static once init is done?",
